---
import ProjectLayout from '../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import ProjectNav from '../components/project/ProjectNav.astro';
import NextProject from '../components/project/NextProject.astro';
import '../styles/projects/ab-portal.css';
---

<ProjectLayout title="AB-Portal · Sasha">
<div class="page" style="font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #2E2326; background: #F6F1EA; min-height: 100vh; padding-bottom: 110px">
<div style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #EBD9D6 0%, #F2E6E3 55%, #F6F1EA 100%); padding-bottom: 48px">
<ProjectNav />
<header class="wrap" style="text-align: center; padding-top: 88px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 26px; color: #9C4F5B">Internship project · IT operations</p>
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(56px, 11vw, 140px); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.9">AB-Portal.</h1>
<p style="margin: 24px auto 0; max-width: 660px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3F3436; text-wrap: balance">Daily IT checks used to mean opening too many separate links and filling each one in. AB-Portal puts them all in one place, so the routine takes less time and less work.</p>
</header>
<div class="col" style="margin-top: 48px">
<div class="meta">
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7A5A5E">Year</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">2026</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7A5A5E">Client</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">IT unit, RS Awal Bros Botania</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7A5A5E">Role</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">UI/UX design, from scratch</p></div>
<div><p style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #7A5A5E">Status</p><p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600">Used by the IT team</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
<div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(140deg, #E3B7BC 0%, #EBD9D6 55%, #F2E6E3 100%)">
<div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 260px; height: 260px; right: -60px; top: -80px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35)"></div>
<div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 180px; height: 180px; left: -50px; bottom: 40px; background: rgba(156,79,91,0.12)"></div>
<div class="browser" style="position: relative">
<div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">portal-monitoring-it / dashboard</span></div>
<img src="assets/abportal-dashboard.webp" alt="AB-Portal home: daily progress ring and today's monitoring forms for user accounts, server temperature, CCTV and clear desk" style="width: 100%; display: block">
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 48px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 14px">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">26</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">pages, all designed by me</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">9</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">question types in the form builder</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">5</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">steps in a device's life, tracked</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 22px; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1">H-1</p><p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5E5153">email before a vendor repair is due</p></div>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 80px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Too many links, every single day</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px">Before AB-Portal, the daily checks were spread across a pile of separate links, each one to open and fill in on its own. It was slow and easy to lose track of. So we pulled everything into one portal.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px">The IT team runs the same routine checks every day: are user accounts right, is the server room too warm, are the CCTV cameras up, did people leave their desks and screens clean. AB-Portal puts each check on a card. Open it, fill a short form, send. Every report gets its own number, like <code style="font-size: 15px; background: #F2E6E3; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px">F30-202611-0003</code>.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">The ring at the top shows how many of today's forms are filled, so nobody has to ask "did someone already check the server room?" If an answer looks wrong (say, a user that doesn't match), it lands in a <strong style="color: #2E2326">Needs attention</strong> list and the bell icon lights up.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 56px">
<div class="duo" style="align-items: stretch">
<figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div class="panel" style="background: #D8E9E0; flex: 1">
<div class="browser round tilt" style="width: 100%">
<div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">/forms/kesesuaian-user</span></div>
<img src="assets/abportal-form.webp" alt="A daily check form for user accounts with username, match status and login time" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 0; display: block">
</div>
</div>
<figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">A check is just a short form. This one confirms user accounts.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div class="panel" style="background: #EBD9D6; flex: 1">
<img class="tilt" src="assets/abportal-addform.webp" alt="Add form dialog with title, description, icon picker, accent color and live card preview" style="width: min(78%, 420px); display: block; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -28px rgba(80,40,46,0.5)">
</div>
<figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">New check? The team adds it themselves: title, icon, colour, with a live preview.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">Forms the team builds themselves</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px">New checks can be added straight from the portal, no code changes needed. It has its own form builder, a bit like Google Forms: nine question types, photo uploads, follow-up questions that only appear for certain answers, and a small warning icon to mark which answers "need attention".</p>
<p style="margin: 0">Each form also gets a schedule: daily, weekly, monthly, yearly or on set dates, with an optional deadline that flags it as "not filled yet". Every save creates a new version, so old reports keep the questions they were answered with.</p>
</article>

<div class="wrap" style="padding-top: 40px">
<div class="duo" style="align-items: stretch">
<figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div class="panel" style="background: #EBD9D6; flex: 1">
<div class="browser round tilt" style="width: 100%">
<div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">/form-editor · questions</span></div>
<img src="assets/abportal-editor.webp" alt="Form editor with question cards, answer types, attention and follow-up icons, and a side panel to add questions" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 8%; display: block">
</div>
</div>
<figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">The editor: question types, required toggle, and per-option “needs attention” and follow-up icons.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div class="panel" style="background: #D8E9E0; flex: 1">
<div class="browser round tilt2" style="width: 100%">
<div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">/form-editor · schedule</span></div>
<img src="assets/abportal-schedule.webp" alt="Schedule tab with daily, weekly, monthly, yearly options, start date, deadline and a calendar preview" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 20%; display: block">
</div>
</div>
<figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">The schedule tab, with a calendar that previews which days the form shows up.</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>

<article class="col" style="padding-top: 72px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: #3F3436">
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #2E2326">And every device, from day one to disposal</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px">The second half tracks the hospital's IT hardware through its whole life. Every device is found by its barcode, scanned with a USB or Bluetooth scanner or the phone camera. No barcode? The portal makes one, like <code style="font-size: 15px; background: #F2E6E3; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px">AB-BTN-OTH-0001</code>, ready to print.</p>
<div class="life">
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #9C4F5B">01</span><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326; font-size: 15px">Register</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45">Scan barcode, print label</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #9C4F5B">02</span><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326; font-size: 15px">Place</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45">Location and owner</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #9C4F5B">03</span><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326; font-size: 15px">Track</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45">Where it is, where it's been</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #9C4F5B">04</span><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326; font-size: 15px">Service</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45">Track repairs, email H-1 before vendor deadline</p></div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px"><span style="display: block; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #9C4F5B">05</span><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font-weight: 700; color: #2E2326; font-size: 15px">Dispose</p><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45">Approved, history kept</p></div>
</div>
<figure style="margin: 28px 0 0"><div class="stage" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #F2E6E3 0%, #EBD9D6 100%); padding: clamp(16px,4vw,40px) clamp(16px,4vw,40px) 0; border-radius: 28px"><div class="browser"><div class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background: #E0796F"></i><i style="background: #E6B95C"></i><i style="background: #7DBE7A"></i><span class="url">/aset-it</span></div><img src="assets/abportal-assets.webp" alt="IT asset management page with forms for registration, placement, tracking, service and disposal, plus recaps" style="width: 100%; display: block"></div></div><figcaption style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; color: #6B5F60">Each step is its own form, with recaps and a CSV export of the full device list.</figcaption></figure>

<div style="margin-top: 40px; background: #EBD9D6; border-radius: 28px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 28px; align-items: center">
<img src="assets/abportal-service.webp" alt="Service and maintenance page showing active repairs, a priority list with due dates and a barcode field" style="width: min(380px, 100%); flex: none; display: block; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 30px 50px -24px rgba(80,40,46,0.5); transform: rotate(-2deg)">
<div style="flex: 1 1 260px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #9C4F5B">Nothing slips past the vendor deadline</p>
<p style="margin: 0">Repairs move through Reported, In progress, Waiting for parts and Done. The ones due soonest float to the top, and the portal emails a reminder the day before a vendor deadline.</p>
</div>
</div>

<p style="margin: 40px 0 0">Behind all of it, every action is written to a read-only activity log: who logged in, who changed which report, and why it was deleted.</p>

<div style="margin-top: 64px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #EDE3DB; border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 24px; color: #9C4F5B">My part</p>
<p style="margin: 0">I designed AB-Portal from scratch, all 26 pages: how the daily checks are organised into cards, the form builder and its schedule, and the whole asset flow from barcode to disposal.</p>
</div>
</article>

<div class="col" style="padding-top: 96px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B5F60; font-weight: 600">Next project</p>
<NextProject href="pharmatrack.html" name="PharmaTrack" bg="#CFE6DC" />
</div>
</div>
</ProjectLayout>
